<title>SPAIN: Spain investment funds up 68 bln pta in Apr vs Mar.</title>
<headline>Spain investment funds up 68 bln pta in Apr vs Mar.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish investment funds totalled 22.01 trillion pesetas at the end of April, versus 21.33 trillion pesetas at the end of March, the Spanish association of investment and pension funds (Inverco) reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The statement added that the 0.68 trillion peseta increase was due to new savings and higher market prices.</p>
<p>Investment trusts in the country have grown 7.9 trillion pesetas in the last year.</p>
<p>The number of investors rose to 5,245,930, with 133,753 new investors during April.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
